---@description "미니게임 서버 입력 payload 검증과 정규화"
@Logic
script MiniGameInputRule extends Logic

	property string PLACEMENT_SEPARATOR = ";"
	property string FIELD_SEPARATOR = ","
	property string CELL_KEY_SEPARATOR = ":"

	property string REASON_EMPTY_PAYLOAD = "emptyPayload"
	property string REASON_INVALID_FORMAT = "invalidFormat"
	property string REASON_INVALID_CONFIG = "invalidConfig"
	property string REASON_UNKNOWN_BLOCK = "unknownBlock"
	property string REASON_DUPLICATE_BLOCK = "duplicateBlock"
	property string REASON_MISSING_BLOCK = "missingBlock"
	property string REASON_INVALID_ROTATION = "invalidRotation"
	property string REASON_OUT_OF_BOARD = "outOfBoard"
	property string REASON_OVERLAP = "overlap"
	property integer MAX_SELECTION_PAYLOAD_LENGTH = 256

	method boolean Supports(integer inputType)
		-- 공용 서버 입력 규칙 지원 여부 반환
		return inputType == _EMiniGameInputType.Selection
	end

	method any ValidateSelection(any preset, string payload)
		-- Selection payload를 서버 프리셋 기준으로 검증하고 절대 셀 좌표 생성
		if payload == nil or payload == "" then
			return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_EMPTY_PAYLOAD)
		end
		if #payload > self.MAX_SELECTION_PAYLOAD_LENGTH then
			return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_INVALID_FORMAT)
		end

		local inputConfig = preset ~= nil and preset.inputConfig or nil
		local blockCatalog = preset ~= nil and preset.blockCatalog or nil
		local boardRows = inputConfig ~= nil and inputConfig.boardRows or 0
		local boardColumns = inputConfig ~= nil and inputConfig.boardColumns or 0
		if boardRows <= 0 or boardColumns <= 0 or blockCatalog == nil or #blockCatalog == 0 then
			return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_INVALID_CONFIG)
		end

		local sourcePlacements = self:ParsePlacements(payload)
		if sourcePlacements == nil or #sourcePlacements ~= #blockCatalog then
			return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_INVALID_FORMAT)
		end

		local usedBlockIds = {}
		local occupiedCells = {}
		local validatedPlacements = {}
		for _, source in ipairs(sourcePlacements) do
			local block = self:FindBlock(blockCatalog, source.blockId)
			if block == nil then
				return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_UNKNOWN_BLOCK)
			end
			if usedBlockIds[source.blockId] == true then
				return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_DUPLICATE_BLOCK)
			end
			if self:IsAllowedRotation(block, source.rotation) == false then
				return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_INVALID_ROTATION)
			end

			local rotatedCells = self:BuildRotatedCells(block.cells, source.rotation)
			if rotatedCells == nil or #rotatedCells == 0 then
				return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_INVALID_CONFIG)
			end
			local absoluteCells = {}
			for _, cell in ipairs(rotatedCells) do
				local row = source.row + cell.row
				local column = source.column + cell.column
				if row < 0 or row >= boardRows or column < 0 or column >= boardColumns then
					return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_OUT_OF_BOARD)
				end

				local cellKey = tostring(row) .. self.CELL_KEY_SEPARATOR .. tostring(column)
				if occupiedCells[cellKey] ~= nil then
					return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_OVERLAP)
				end
				occupiedCells[cellKey] = source.blockId
				absoluteCells[#absoluteCells + 1] = {
					row = row,
					column = column,
					multiplier = tonumber(cell.multiplier) or 0
				}
			end

			usedBlockIds[source.blockId] = true
			validatedPlacements[#validatedPlacements + 1] = {
				blockId = source.blockId,
				row = source.row,
				column = source.column,
				rotation = source.rotation,
				cells = absoluteCells
			}
		end

		for _, block in ipairs(blockCatalog) do
			if usedBlockIds[block.id] ~= true then
				return self:BuildFailure(self.REASON_MISSING_BLOCK)
			end
		end

		return {
			isValid = true,
			reason = "",
			selection = {
				boardRows = boardRows,
				boardColumns = boardColumns,
				placements = validatedPlacements,
				occupiedCells = occupiedCells,
				isConfirmed = true
			}
		}
	end

	method any ParsePlacements(string payload)
		-- blockId,row,column,rotation 반복 문자열 해석
		local placements = {}
		local placementPattern = "(.-)" .. self.PLACEMENT_SEPARATOR
		for placementText in string.gmatch(payload .. self.PLACEMENT_SEPARATOR, placementPattern) do
			if placementText == "" then
				return nil
			end

			local fields = self:SplitFields(placementText)
			if fields == nil or #fields ~= 4 then
				return nil
			end

			local row = self:ParseInteger(fields[2])
			local column = self:ParseInteger(fields[3])
			local rotation = self:ParseInteger(fields[4])
			if fields[1] == "" or row == nil or column == nil or rotation == nil then
				return nil
			end

			placements[#placements + 1] = {
				blockId = fields[1],
				row = row,
				column = column,
				rotation = rotation
			}
		end
		return placements
	end

	method any SplitFields(string placementText)
		-- 배치 항목의 쉼표 구분 필드 해석
		local fields = {}
		local fieldPattern = "(.-)" .. self.FIELD_SEPARATOR
		for field in string.gmatch(placementText .. self.FIELD_SEPARATOR, fieldPattern) do
			fields[#fields + 1] = field
		end
		return fields
	end

	method any ParseInteger(string text)
		-- 정수 형식 필드 변환
		local value = tonumber(text)
		if value == nil or value ~= math.floor(value) then
			return nil
		end
		return value
	end

	method any FindBlock(any blockCatalog, string blockId)
		-- 서버 카탈로그에서 블록 원본 조회
		for _, block in ipairs(blockCatalog) do
			if block.id == blockId then
				return block
			end
		end
		return nil
	end

	method boolean IsAllowedRotation(any block, integer rotation)
		-- 서버 카탈로그에 선언된 회전값 여부 확인
		if block == nil or block.rotations == nil then
			return false
		end
		if rotation ~= 0 and rotation ~= 90 and rotation ~= 180 and rotation ~= 270 then
			return false
		end
		for _, allowedRotation in ipairs(block.rotations) do
			if allowedRotation == rotation then
				return true
			end
		end
		return false
	end

	method any BuildRotatedCells(any sourceCells, integer rotation)
		-- 회전 후 좌상단을 0,0으로 정규화한 상대 셀 생성
		if sourceCells == nil or #sourceCells == 0 then
			return nil
		end
		local rotatedCells = {}
		local minRow = nil
		local minColumn = nil
		for _, sourceCell in ipairs(sourceCells) do
			local row = sourceCell.row
			local column = sourceCell.column
			local rotatedRow = row
			local rotatedColumn = column
			if rotation == 90 then
				rotatedRow = column
				rotatedColumn = -row
			elseif rotation == 180 then
				rotatedRow = -row
				rotatedColumn = -column
			elseif rotation == 270 then
				rotatedRow = -column
				rotatedColumn = row
			end

			rotatedCells[#rotatedCells + 1] = {
				row = rotatedRow,
				column = rotatedColumn,
				multiplier = tonumber(sourceCell.multiplier) or 0
			}
			if minRow == nil or rotatedRow < minRow then
				minRow = rotatedRow
			end
			if minColumn == nil or rotatedColumn < minColumn then
				minColumn = rotatedColumn
			end
		end

		for _, cell in ipairs(rotatedCells) do
			cell.row = cell.row - minRow
			cell.column = cell.column - minColumn
		end
		return rotatedCells
	end

	method any BuildFailure(string reason)
		-- 검증 실패 결과 생성
		return { isValid = false, reason = reason or self.REASON_INVALID_FORMAT }
	end

end
